water.org/content/River/detail/id/4303/)\n\n[Pike Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/10886/) [Poultney](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1383/)[Putnam Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4253/) [Raquette (1.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1385/)\n\n[Rock River](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1391/) [Schroon (North Hudson to Schroon Falls)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1422/) [Schroon (Starbuckville to Riverbank)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1423/)[Schroon (Warrensburg to Thurman Station)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1421/)\n\n[Squaw Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/3886/) [Styles Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4281/) [Thirteenth Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1443/) [Trout brook (Schroon trib)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/3284/)\n\n[West Mill Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4314/)\n\n**[Google Map of New York Whitewater](https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=zjdnDE8H0TLg.kJnMWGapL4xk)**\n\n**[New York Whitewater Paddlers Facebook Group](https://www.facebook.com/groups/108070075877312/)**","averageGradient":"150","maxGradient":null,"length":"3.1","correlations":[{"reachID":"1184","isPrimary":true,"correlationDetails":{"metric":"levelFT","belowRecommendedRangeComment":null,"lowRunnableRangeComment":null,"mediumRunnableRangeComment":null,"highRunnableRangeComment":null,"aboveRecommendedRangeComment":null,"lowRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"highRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"beginLowRunnable":"7","beginMediumRunnable":null,"beginHighRunnable":null,"endHighRunnable":"10"},"gaugeInfo":{"name":"HUDSON RIVER AT NORTH CREEK NY","gaugeSource":"USGS","gaugeSourceIdentifier"